msgid ""
"(Only for transparent mode federated search between Splunk platform "
"deployments) Optional. Specifies whether to limit indexes to specific "
"remote federated providers. Use \"splunk_federated_provider=local\" to "
"refer to the local Splunk search head. This option is not case-sensitive."
" Negated selection (splunk_federated_provider!=<string>) is not "
"supported. Do not include this specifier in search filters. For role-"
"based access control of Splunk federated providers, use `authorize.conf` "
"instead."
msgstr ""
"（僅適用於 Splunk platform 部署之間的透明模式同盟搜尋）選用。指定是否將索引限制為特定的遠端同盟提供者。使用 \"splunk_federated_provider=local\" 來指向本機 Splunk 搜尋頭。此選項不區分大小寫。不支援否定選取（splunk_federated_provider!=<string>）。請勿在搜尋篩選器中包含此指定詞。若要對 Splunk 同盟提供者進行以角色為基礎的存取控制，請改用 `authorize.conf`。"

