msgid ""
"A source type is a field that defines how the Splunk platform handles a "
"piece of incoming data. The source type defines specifications for line "
"break behavior, timestamp location, and character set."
msgstr "來源類型是一個定義 Splunk 平台如何處理傳入資料片段的欄位。來源類型定義換行行為、時間戳記位置和字元集的規格。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/packages/admin-user-xp/src/features/sourcetypes/i18n/messages.ts:187 
msgid ""
"A source type name cannot include the following characters: <, >, ?, #, "
"&. Modify the name."
msgstr ""
"來源類型名稱不能包含下列字元：<、>、?、#、&。請修改名稱。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5306 
msgid ""
"A span of each bin, based on time. If <int> is not specified, 1 is "
"assumed. \\\n"
"For example, if day is specified for the <timescale>, 1day is assumed."
msgstr ""
"每個 bin 的跨距，以時間為基礎。如果未指定 <int>，則假定為 1。\\\n"
"例如，如果為 <timescale> 指定天，則假定為 1 天。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4813 
msgid "A sparkline specifier optionally renamed to a new field name."
msgstr "被選擇性重新命名為新欄位名稱的 sparkline 指定子。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4822 
msgid ""
"A sparkline specifier, which takes the first argument of a aggregation "
"function on a field, \\\n"
"optionally followed by a timespan specifier.  If no timespan specifier is"
" used, an appropriate \\\n"
"timespan is chosen based on the time range of the search.  If the "
"sparkline is not scoped to a field, \\\n"
"only the count aggregator is permitted."
msgstr ""
"sparkline 指定子，會抓取欄位上彙總函數的第一個引數。\\\n"
"選擇性的接著一個 timespan 指定子。若未使用 timespan 指定子，會根據搜尋的時間範圍選擇適當的\\\n"
"timespan。若走勢圖範圍不是設定為欄位，\\\n"
"則只允許個數彙總工具。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web/search_mrsparkle/templates/licensing/pools/add.html:80 
msgid "A specific amount"
msgstr "特定量"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4852 
msgid ""
"A specifier formed by a aggregation function applied to a field or set of"
" fields.  \\\n"
"As of 4.0, it can also be an aggregation function applied to a arbitrary "
"eval expression.  \\\n"
"The eval expression must be wrapped by \"eval(\" and \")\".  \\\n"
"If no field is specified in the parenthesis, \\\n"
"the aggregation is applied independently to all fields, \\\n"
"and is equivalent to calling a field value of *\\\n"
"When a numeric aggregator is applied to a not-completely-numeric field \\"
"\n"
"no column is generated for that aggregation."
msgstr ""
"由套用至欄位或一組欄位的彙總函數所形成的指定子。\\\n"
"截至 4.0 版，亦可以是套用至任意 eval 運算式的彙總函數。\\\n"
"eval 運算式必須採用 [eval(] 和 [)] 包起。\\\n"
"若括弧中未指定欄位，\\\n"
"彙總會獨立套用至所有欄位，\\\n"
"且等同於呼叫 * 的欄位值\\\n"
"數值彙總工具套用至不完全是數值的欄位時，\\\n"
"彙總不會產生任何欄。"

