#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:597 
msgid ""
"Calculate a moving average of event size; the first N average numbers are"
" omitted by eval since summing null fields results in null."
msgstr "計算事件大小之移動平均；第一個 N 平均數字由 eval 忽略，因為總和 null 欄位之結果為 null。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4782 
msgid ""
"Calculate aggregate statistics over the dataset, optionally grouped by a "
"list of fields.\\\n"
"Aggregate statistics include: \\i\\\\\n"
"* count, distinct count \\i\\\\\n"
"* mean, median, mode \\i\\\\\n"
"* min, max, range, percentiles \\i\\\\\n"
"* standard deviation, variance \\i\\\\\n"
"* sum \\i\\\\\n"
"* earliest and latest occurrence \\i\\\\\n"
"* first and last (according to input order into stats command) occurrence"
" \\p\\\\\n"
"Similar to SQL aggregation. \\\n"
"If called without a by-clause, one row is produced, which represents the "
"\\\n"
"aggregation over the entire incoming result set. If called with a \\\n"
"by-clause, one row is produced for each distinct value of the by-clause. "
"\\\n"
"The 'partitions' option, if specified, allows stats to partition the \\\n"
"input data based on the split-by fields for multithreaded reduce. \\\n"
"The 'allnum' option, if true (default = false), computes numerical "
"statistics on each \\\n"
"field if and only if all of the values of that field are numerical. \\\n"
"The 'delim' option is used to specify how the values in the 'list' or "
"'values' aggregation are delimited.  (default is a single space)\\\n"
"When called with the name \"prestats\", it will produce intermediate "
"results (internal)."
msgstr ""
"計算 dataset 的彙總統計資料。選擇性的依欄位清單分組。\\\n"
"彙總統計資料包括:\\i\\\\\n"
"* 數量、明確數量 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 平均數、中位數、模式 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 最小值、最大值、範圍、百分位數 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 標準差、變異數 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 總和 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 最早與最晚發生 \\i\\\\\n"
"* 第一次和最後一次 (根據輸入至 stats 命令的順序) 發生 \\p\\\\\n"
"與 SQL 彙總類似。\\\n"
"若未採用 [by-] 子句呼叫，會產生列，代表整個傳入結果集\\\n"
"的彙總。若採用\\\n"
"[by-] 子句呼叫，[by-] 子句的各相異值會產生一列。\\\n"
"若指定 [partitions] 選項，則 stats 會根據 [split-by] 欄位分割\\\n"
"輸入資料以進行多執行緒的縮減。\\\n"
"若 [allnum] 選項為 true (預設 = false)，唯有該\\\n"
"欄位所有值都是數值，才會計算數值統計資料。\\\n"
"[delim] 選項用來指定 [list] 或 [values] 彙總中要分隔值的方式。(預設為單一空格)\\\n"
"以名稱 [prestats] 呼叫時，會產生中繼結果 (內部)。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5163 
msgid "Calculate the average value of \"CPU\" each minute for each \"host\"."
msgstr "計算各 [host] 每分鐘的 [CPU] 平均值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1022 
