"Calculate the number of concurrent events for each event start time and "
"emit as field 'foo'"
msgstr "計算各事件開始時間的並行事件數，並發出為欄位 [foo]"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:869 
msgid ""
"Calculate the number of concurrent events using the 'et' field as the "
"start time \\\n"
"and 'length' as the duration."
msgstr ""
"Calculate the number of concurrent events using the 'et' field as the start time \\\n"
"and 'length' as the duration."

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:871 
msgid ""
"Calculate the number of ongoing http requests at the start time of each "
"http request in a splunk access log"
msgstr "計算 splunk 存取記錄中每個 http 要求之開始時間之進行中 http 要求之數量。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1799 
msgid ""
"Calculate the sum of the values in the multivalue field 'mv'. Place the "
"sum in the 'total' field."
msgstr "計算多重值欄位 [mv] 中值的加總。將加總置於 [total] 欄位中。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:261 
