#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/Script.js:6 
msgid ""
"Configure selected Splunk Universal Forwarders to execute a script or "
"command \n"
"                    and index its output as event data. Scripted inputs "
"are useful when the data you want to index \n"
"                    isn't available in a file to monitor."
msgstr ""
"設定選擇的 Splunk 通用轉送器來執行指令碼或命令，\n"
"                    並擷取其輸出作為事件資料。當您要檢索的資料\n"
"                    無法從要監控的檔案中取得時，指令碼輸入很實用。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/TCPUDP.js:5 
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Configure selected Splunk Universal Forwarders to listen on any %s port \n"
"                    to capture data sent over the network from services "
"such as syslog. "
msgstr ""
"設定選擇的 Splunk 通用轉送器以監聽任何 %s 連接埠，\n"
"                    擷取透過網路從系統記錄之類的服務所傳送的資料。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/WinPerfmonLocal.js:10 
msgid ""
"Configure selected Splunk Universal Forwarders to monitor Windows "
"performance \n"
"                    counters. The performance objects available to the "
"Splunk platform for monitoring depend on the \n"
"                    performance libraries installed on the system. Both "
"Microsoft and third-party vendors provide \n"
"                    libraries that contain performance counters. "
msgstr ""
"設定選擇的 Splunk 通用轉送器可監控 Windows 效能\n"
"                    計數器。適合 Splunk 平台用於監控的效能物件視\n"
"                    系統安裝的效能程式庫而定。Microsoft 和協力廠商二者皆提供\n"
"                    包含效能計數器的程式庫。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/FilesAndDirs.html:6 
msgid ""
"Configure selected Splunk Universal Forwarders to monitor both existing "
"and new data within a file or directory. If you choose to monitor a "
"directory, you can only assign a single source type to the data within "
"that directory. If a directory contains different log files from various "
"applications or sources, configure individual file monitor inputs for "
"each type of log file (you will have an opportunity to set individual "
"source types this way). If the specified directory contains "
"subdirectories, the Splunk platform recursively examines them for new "
"files."
msgstr "設定選擇的 Splunk 通用轉送器可監控檔案或目錄中的現有和新資料。如果選擇監控目錄，您只能將單一來源類型指派給目錄中的資料。如果目錄包含各種應用系統或來源的不同日誌記錄檔，請設定各類記錄檔的個別檔案監控輸入 (您可利用這種方式來設定個別來源類型)。如果指定的目錄包含子目錄，Splunk 平台會以遞迴方式檢查它們是否有新檔案。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/WinEventLogsLocal.js:7 
msgid ""
"Configure selected Splunk Universal Forwarders to monitor local Windows "
"event log \n"
"                    channels, which contain log data published by "
"installed applications, services, and system processes. \n"
"                    The event log monitor runs once for every event log "
"input defined in the Splunk platform. "
msgstr ""
"設定選擇的 Splunk 通用轉送器可監控本機 Windows 事件記錄檔\n"
"                    管道，包含安裝的應用系統、服務和系統程序所發佈的記錄資料。\n"
"                    系統會針對 Splunk 平台中定義的每個事件記錄檔輸入，執行此事件記錄檔監控一次。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/packages/admin-user-xp/src/features/adminEmailSettings/utils/localizations.ts:15 
msgid ""
"Configure server settings, domains, a format for emails, and settings for"
" PDF reports."
msgstr "設定伺服器設定、網域、電子郵件格式，及 PDF 報告的設定。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/InputList.html:28 
msgid "Configure the Splunk platform to listen on a network port."
msgstr "設定 Splunk 平台以監聽網路連接埠。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/clustering/SuccessContents.html:5 
msgid "Configure the indexes for the peers."
msgstr "設定對等節點的索引。"

