msgstr "轉換為內置面板可讓您在此儀表格上編輯和自訂面板。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/splunkjs/mvc/simplexml/dashboard/panelref.js:208 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/dashboard/layout/PanelRef.js:227 
msgid "Convert"
msgstr "轉換"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:983 
msgid "Convert a MM:SS.SSS format to seconds."
msgstr "將 MM:SS.SSS 格式轉換為秒。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:977 
msgid "Convert a duration format \"[D+]HH:MM:SS\" to seconds."
msgstr "將 duration 格式「[D+]HH:MM:SS」轉換為秒。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:987 
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Convert a {KB, MB, GB} denominated size quantity into a KB"
msgstr "將以 {KB, MB, GB} 表示的大小數量轉換為 KB"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2727 
msgid ""
"Convert all events into JSON output. Apply appropriate types to all "
"fields."
msgstr "將所有事件轉換為 JSON 輸出。將適當的類型套用到所有的欄位。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2796 
msgid ""
"Convert all fields, including internal fields, into JSON format. Assign a"
" 'null' value to fields that are skipped."
msgstr "將所有欄位 (包括內部欄位) 轉換為 JSON 格式。將「null」值指派給遭略過的欄位。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2769 
msgid ""
"Convert all values for the specified field into the JSON type, using "
"string validation. \\\n"
"If the value is a number, the 'tojson' processor outputs that number. If "
"the value is a string, the 'tojson' \\\n"
"processor examines the string. If the string is valid JSON, the 'tojson' "
"processor outputs the string as a JSON \\\n"
"block. If the field is invalid JSON, the 'tojson' processor skips it. \\\n"
"If the field contains multivalues, the 'tojson' processor outputs a JSON "
"array where each element is evaluated and typed \\\n"
"according to the preceding criteria."
msgstr ""
"使用字串驗證，將所指定欄位的所有值轉換為 JSON 類型。\\\n"
"如果值為數字，則「tojson」處理器會輸出該數字。如果值為字串，則「tojson」\\\n"
"處理器會檢查該字串。如果字串為有效 JSON，則「tojson」處理器會將字串輸出為 JSON \\\n"
"區塊。如果欄位為無效的 JSON，則「tojson」處理器會略過該欄位。\\\n"
"如果欄位包含多重值，則「tojson」處理器會輸出 JSON 陣列，系統會根據之前的準則，在此陣列中\\\n"
"評估與輸入每個元素。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2723 
msgid ""
"Convert all values of the specified field into JSON-formatted output. "
"Automatically determine the field datatypes. \\\n"
"If the value is numeric, the JSON output has a numeric type and includes "
"a literal numeric. \\\n"
"If the value is the string 'true' or 'false', the JSON output has a "
"boolean type. \\\n"
"If the value is a literal \"null\", the JSON output has a null type and "
"includes a null value. \\\n"
"If the value is a string, the 'tojson' processor examines the string. If "
"it is proper JSON, the 'tojson' processor \\\n"
"outputs a nested JSON object. If it is not proper JSON, the JSON output "
"includes the string. \\\n"
"When a field contains multivalues, the 'tojson' processor outputs a JSON "
"array where the preceding criteria are applied \\\n"
"to each element of the array."
msgstr ""
"將所指定欄位的所有值轉換為 JSON 格式的輸出。自動決定欄位資料類型。\\\n"
"如果值為數值，則 JSON 輸出具有數值欄位，且包含常值數值。\\\n"
"如果值字串「true」或「false」，則 JSON 輸出具有布林值類型。\\\n"
"如果值為常值「null」，則 JSON 輸出具有 null 值類型，且包含 null 值。\\\n"
"如果值為字串，則「tojson」處理器會檢查該字串。如果為適當的 JSON，則「tojson」處理器\\\n"
"會輸出巢狀 JSON 物件。如果它不是適當的 JSON，則 JSON 輸出包含該字串。\\\n"
"當欄位包含多重值時，「tojson」處理器會輸出 JSON 陣列，在此系統會將之前的準則套用至\\\n"
"陣列的每個元素。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2758 
msgid ""
"Convert all values of the specified field into the boolean type. \\\n"
"If the value is a number, the 'tojson' processor outputs 'false' only if "
"that value is '0'. Otherwise, the \\\n"
"'tojson' processor outputs 'true'. \\\n"
"If the value is a string, the 'tojson' processor outputs 'false' only if "
"the value is 'false', 'f', or 'no'. The \\\n"
"'tojson' processor outputs 'true' if the value is 'true', 't', or 'yes. "
"If the string is neither of the above, it is skipped  \\\n"
"When a field contains multivalues, the 'tojson' processor outputs a JSON "
"array where 'true' and 'false' values are \\\n"
"applied according to the preceding criteria."
msgstr ""
"將所指定欄位的所有值轉為布林值類型。\\\n"
"如果值為數字，則只有在該值為 0 時，「tojson」處理器才會輸出「false」。否則，\\\n"
"「tojson」處理器會輸出「true」。\\\n"
"如果值為字串，則「tojson」處理器只有在值為「false」、「f」或「no」時才會輸出「false」。\\\n"
"如果值為「true」、「t」或「yes」，則「tojson」處理器會輸出「true」。如果字串不是上述任何一個值，則會略過該字串。\\\n"
"當欄位包含多重值時，「tojson」處理器會輸出 JSON 陣列，系統在此會根據之前的準則\\\n"
"套用「true」與「false」值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2736 
msgid ""
"Convert all values of the specified field into the numeric type. \\\n"
"If the value is already a number, the 'tojson' processor outputs that "
"value and gives it the numeric type. If the \\\n"
"value is a string, the 'tojson' processor attempts to parse that string "
"as a number -- if it can't, it skips that value. \\\n"
"When a field is multivalued, 'tojson' processor outputs a JSON array "
"where each element of the array has the \\\n"
"numeric type."
msgstr ""
"將所指定欄位的所有值轉換為數值類型。\\\n"
"如果值已經是數字，則「tojson」處理器會輸出該值，並將數值類型授與該值。\\\n"
"如果值為字串，則「tojson」處理器會嘗試將該字串剖析為數字 -- 如果無法剖析，則略過該值。\\\n"
"當欄位有多重值時，「tojson」處理器會輸出 JSON 陣列，此陣列中的每個元素皆具有\\\n"
"數值類型。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2746 
msgid ""
"Convert all values of the specified field into the string type. \\\n"
"The 'tojson' processor gives all values of the specified field the string"
" type, even if they are numbers, \\\n"
"booleans, and so on. \\\n"
"When a field contains multivalues, 'tojson' processor outputs a JSON "
"array where each element of the array has the \\\n"
"string type."
msgstr ""
"將所指定欄位的所有值轉換為字串類型。\\\n"
"「tojson」處理器會將字串類型授與所指定欄位的所有值，即使值為數值、\\\n"
"布林值等等亦如此。\\\n"
"當欄位包含多重值時，「tojson」處理器會輸出 JSON 陣列，此陣列中的每個元素具有\\\n"
"字串類型。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:967 
msgid ""
"Convert an epoch time to an ascii human readable time.  Use timeformat "
"option to specify exact format to convert to."
msgstr "將 epoch 時間轉換為 ascii 人類可讀時間。使用 timeformat 選項，指定要轉換的確切目標格式。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:972 
msgid ""
"Convert an human readable time string to an epoch time.  Use timeformat "
"option to specify exact format to convert from."
msgstr "將人類可讀的時間字串轉換為 epoch 時間。使用 timeformat 選項，指定要轉換的確切來源格式。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2704 
msgid "Convert each event in the index \"_internal\" into a JSON representation."
msgstr "將索引 [_internal] 中的每個事件轉換為 JSON 代表。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2707 
msgid ""
"Convert events into JSON objects that have only the 'date_*' fields from "
"each event, where the field 'date_hour' \\\n"
"is interpreted as a numeric datatype and the other date fields are "
"interpreted as string datatypes."
msgstr ""
"將事件轉換為僅具有每個事件中 [date_*] 欄位的 JSON 物件，其中系統會將 [date_hour] 欄位\\\n"
"解譯為數值資料類型，將其他日期欄位解譯為字串資料類型。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:936 
msgid ""
"Convert every field value to a number value except for values in the "
"field \"foo\" (use the \"none\" argument to specify fields to ignore)."
msgstr "除了欄位 [foo] 的值以外，將任何欄位值轉換為數值 (使用「none」引數指定要忽略的欄位)。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1529 
msgid ""
"Convert the JSON array containing string \"hello\" and \"world\" into a "
"multivalue field."
msgstr "將包含字串「hello」及「world」的 JSON 陣列轉換為多值欄位。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2737 
msgid ""
"Convert the field 'count' into JSON output. Apply the numeric type to "
"that field."
msgstr "將欄位 [count] 轉換為 JSON 輸出。將數值類型套用至該欄位。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2759 
msgid ""
"Convert the field 'isInternal' into a JSON output. Apply the boolean type"
" to that field."
msgstr "將欄位 [isInternal] 轉換為 JSON 輸出。將布林值類型套用至該欄位。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2747 
msgid ""
"Convert the field 'students' into a JSON output. Apply the string type to"
" that field."
msgstr "將欄位 [students] 轉換為 JSON 輸出。將字串類型套用至該欄位。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2770 
msgid ""
"Convert the field 'test_inputs' into a JSON object. Apply the JSON type "
"to that field."
msgstr "將欄位 [test_inputs] 轉換為 JSON 物件。將 JSON 類型套用至該欄位。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2794 
msgid ""
"Convert the fields 'age','height', and 'weight' into number types, "
"convert 'name' into a string type, and write the JSON to the field "
"'my_json_field'."
msgstr "將欄位 [age]、[height] 和 [weight] 轉換為數字類型，將 [name] 轉換為字串類型，並將 JSON 寫入欄位 [my_json_field]。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2780 
msgid ""
"Convert the fields 'name' and 'age' into a JSON representation. Apply the"
" none type to both fields."
msgstr "將欄位 [name] 和 [age] 轉換為 JSON 代表。將無類型套用至這兩個欄位。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1531 
msgid ""
"Convert the multivalue field containing elements \"hello\" and \"world\" "
"into a JSON array."
msgstr "將包含元素「hello」及「world」的多值欄位轉換為 JSON 陣列。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1328 
msgid ""
"Convert the values in the 'username' field to lowercase and place the "
"values into the 'lowuser' field."
msgstr "將 [username] 欄位中的值轉換為小寫，並將值置於 [lowuser] 欄位中。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/splunkjs/mvc/simplexml/dashboard/panelref.js:36 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/splunkjs/mvc/simplexml/dashboard/panelref.js:207 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/dashboard/layout/PanelRef.js:191 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/dashboard/layout/PanelRef.js:226 
msgid "Convert to Inline Panel"
msgstr "轉換為內置面板"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/splunkjs/mvc/simplexml/dashboard/panel.js:25 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/splunkjs/mvc/simplexml/dialog/convertpanel.js:64 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/dashboard/editor/dialogs/ConvertPanel.js:85 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/dashboard/layout/Panel.js:175 
msgid "Convert to Prebuilt Panel"
msgstr "轉換為預建面板"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/dashboard/editor/dialogs/CreateReport.js:54 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/dashboard/editor/dialogs/EditSearch.js:508 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/dashboards/panelcontrols/CreateReportDialog.js:58 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/dashboards/panelcontrols/Master.js:125 
msgid "Convert to Report"
msgstr "轉換為報告"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/search/title/Master.js:218 
msgid "Convert to SPL2"
msgstr "轉換為 SPL2"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:942 
msgid ""
"Convert values of the \"duration\" field into number value by removing "
"string values in the field value. For example,  if \"duration=\"212 "
"sec\"\", the resulting value will be \"duration=\"212\"\"."
msgstr "移除欄位值中的字串值，將 [duration] 欄位的值轉換為數值。例如，若  duration=\"212 sec\"，結果值將是 duration=\"212\"。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2696 
msgid "Converts event data into JSON format."
msgstr "將事件資料轉換為 JSON 格式。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2703 
msgid ""
"Converts events into JSON objects. Specify which fields get converted by "
"identifying them through exact match or \\\n"
"through wildcard expressions. Apply datatypes to field values with "
"datatype functions. \\\n"
"In the JSON object, the key is the name of the field. The value is the "
"corresponding field value. \\\n"
"If a field contains a multivalue, the 'tojson' processor converts it into"
" a JSON array. \\\n"
"If you do not specify any fields, the 'tojson' processor creates JSON "
"objects for each event that include all \\\n"
"available fields. In other words, 'tojson' applies the function 'none(*)'"
" to the query. \\\n"
"This command is non-generating."
msgstr ""
"將事件轉換為 JSON 物件。藉由透過完全符合或萬用字元運算式識別欄位，\\\n"
"來指定要轉換哪些欄位。使用資料類型函數將資料類型套用至欄位值。\\\n"
"在 JSON 物件中，索引鍵為該欄位的名稱。值為對應的欄位值。\\\n"
"如果欄位包含多重值，則「tojson」處理器會將該欄位轉換為 JSON 陣列。\\\n"
"如果您未指定任何欄位，則「tojson」處理器會為包含所有可用欄位\\\n"
"的事件建立 JSON 物件。換句話說，「tojson」會將「none(*)」函數套用到查詢。\\\n"
"此命令不是產生的。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:934 
msgid "Converts field values into numerical values."
msgstr "將欄位值轉換為數值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6081 
#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6082 
msgid ""
"Converts results from a tabular format to a format similar to stats "
"output. Inverse of xyseries."
msgstr "將結果從表格格式轉換為相近於 stats 輸出的格式。xyseries 的反轉結果。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6048 
msgid "Converts results into a format suitable for graphing."
msgstr "將結果轉換為適合繪圖的格式。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6055 
msgid ""
"Converts results into a format suitable for graphing.  If multiple \\\n"
"y-data-fields are specified, each column name is the \\\n"
"the y-data-field name followed by the sep string (default is \": \") \\\n"
"and then the value of the y-name-field it applies to. \\\n"
"If the grouped option is set to true (false by default), \\\n"
"then the input is assumed to be sorted by the value of the \\\n"
"<x-field> and multi-file input is allowed."
msgstr ""
"將結果轉換為適合繪圖的格式。若指定了多個 \\\n"
"y-資料-欄位，各欄的名稱會是\\\n"
"y-資料-欄位名稱接著 sep 字串 (預設為 [:\") \\\n"
"，再接著 y-名稱-欄位所套用的目標值。\\\n"
"若分組選項設為 true (預設為 false)，\\\n"
"則假定會依 \\\n"
"<x-field> 的值排序輸入，並允許多檔案輸入。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4627 
msgid ""
"Converts search results into metric data and inserts the data into a "
"metric index \\\n"
"on the indexers. If each result contains only one metric_name field and "
"one \\\n"
"numeric _value field, the result is already a normalized metrics data "
"point, \\\n"
"the result does not need to be split and can be consumed directly. \\\n"
"Otherwise, each result is spit into multiple metric data points based on "
"the specified \\\n"
"list of dimension fields. \\\n"
"Only purely streaming commands can precede the meventcollect command so "
"that results can be \\\n"
"directly ingested on the indexers. \\\n"
"Arguments: \\\n"
"“index”: The index where the collect metric data are placed. This "
"argument is required. \\\n"
"“split”: Determines how meventcollect identifies the measures in an "
"event. Defaults to false. \\\n"
"When split=true, you use <field-list> to identify the dimensions in your "
"search. The  \\\n"
"meventcollect command converts any field in your search that is not part "
"of the <field-list> \\\n"
"into a measurement. \\\n"
"When split=false, the measure field or fields need to be explicitly "
"specified by the \\\n"
"search. \\\n"
"* If you have single-metric events, the search must produce results with "
"a \\\n"
"'metric_name' field for the name of the measure and a '_value' field for "
"the \\\n"
"measure's numeric value. \\\n"
"* If you have multiple-metric events, the search must produce results "
"that include \\\n"
"measures that follow this syntax: "
"'metric_name:<metric_name>=<numeric_value>'. \\\n"
"“spool”: If spool=true (which is the default setting), the metrics data "
"file is written \\\n"
"to the Splunk spool directory, $SPLUNK_HOME/var/spool/splunk, where the "
"file is indexed \\\n"
"automatically. If spool=false, the file is written to the "
"$SPLUNK_HOME/var/run/splunk/collect \\\n"
"directory. The file remains in this directory unless some form of further"
" automation \\\n"
"or administration is done. \\\n"
"“prefix_field”: Is applicable only when split=true. If specified, any "
"event with that \\\n"
"field missing is ignored. Otherwise, the field value is prefixed to the "
"metric name. \\\n"
"\"host\": The name of the host that you want to specify for the collected"
" metrics data. \\\n"
"Only applicable when spool=true. \\\n"
"\"source\": The name of the source that you want to specify for the "
"collected metrics data. \\\n"
"Defaults to the name of search. \\\n"
"\"sourcetype\": The name of the source type that is specified for the "
"collected metrics \\\n"
"data. This setting defaults to mcollect_stash. License usage is not "
"calculated for \\\n"
"data indexed with the mcollect_stash source type. If you change to a "
"different \\\n"
"source type, the Splunk platform calculates license usage for any data "
"indexed \\\n"
"by the meventcollect command. NOTE: Do not change this setting \\\n"
"without assistance from Splunk Professional Services or Splunk Support. "
"Changing \\\n"
"the source type requires a change to the props.conf file. \\\n"
"“field-list”: A list of dimension fields. Optional if split=false (the "
"default), required \\\n"
"if split=true. If “field-list” is not specified, all fields are treated "
"as dimensions \\\n"
"for the data point except for the “prefix_field” and internal fields "
"(fields with an \\\n"
"underscore ’_’ prefix). If “field-list” is specified, the list must be "
"specified \\\n"
"at the end of the meventcollect command arguments.  If “field-list” is "
"specified, all \\\n"
"fields are treated as metric values, except for fields in “field-list”, "
"\\\n"
"the “prefix-field”, and internal fields. \\\n"
"The name of each metric value is the field name prefixed with the "
"”prefix_field” value. \\\n"
"Effectively, one metric data point is returned for each qualifying field "
"that \\\n"
"contains a numerical value. If one search result contains multiple "
"qualifying \\\n"
"metric name/value pairs, the result is split into multiple metric data "
"points."
msgstr ""
"將搜尋結果轉換為度量資料，並將資料插入到索引器上的 \\\n"
"度量索引。如果每個結果只包含一個 metric_name 欄位與一個 \\\n"
"numeric _value 欄位，則結果已經是正常化的度量資料點， \\\n"
"且結果不需要被分割並可直接取用 \\\n"
"否則，會根據指定的維度欄位清單，將每個結果分割成 \\\n"
"多個度量資料點。 \\\n"
"只有純串流命令可以在 meventcollect 命令之前，讓系統可直接在索引器 \\\n"
"上擷取結果。 \\\n"
"引數:  \\\n"
"「index」: 所收集度量資料所在的索引。此引數為必要。 \\\n"
"「split」: 決定 meventcollect 如何識別事件中的測量。預設為 false。 \\\n"
"split=true 時，可以使用 <field-list> 識別搜尋中的維度。 \\\n"
"meventcollect 命令會將不屬於 <field-list> 的搜尋中出現的任何欄位轉換 \\\n"
"為測量。 \\\n"
"split=false 時，一個或多個測量欄位需要由 \\\n"
"搜尋明確指定。 \\\n"
"* 如果有單一度量事件，搜尋必須產生有 \\\n"
"測量名稱的「metric_name」欄位和測量數值的「_value」欄位 \\\n"
"在其中的結果。 \\\n"
"* 如果有多重度量事件，搜尋必須產生包含 \\\n"
"語法為「metric_name:<metric_name>=<numeric_value>」的測量在其中的結果。 \\\n"
"「spool」: 如果 spool=true (此為預設設定)，則會將度量資料檔案寫入 \\\n"
"Splunk spool 目錄，$SPLUNK_HOME/var/spool/splunk，在此會自動索引檔案。 \\\n"
"如果 spool=false，則檔案會寫入 $SPLUNK_HOME/var/run/splunk/collect \\\n"
"目錄。檔案會保留在此目錄中，除非有某種的進一步自動化 \\\n"
"或管理完成。 \\\n"
"「prefix_field」: 僅適用於 split=true 時。若有指定，則會忽略任何缺少 \\\n"
"該欄位的事件。否則，會在度量名稱前加上欄位值。 \\\n"
"「host」: 您要為所收集度量資料指定的主機名稱。 \\\n"
"僅適用於 spool=true。 \\\n"
"「source」: 您想要為所收集度量資料指定的來源名稱。 \\\n"
"預設為搜尋名稱。 \\\n"
"「sourcetype」: 為所收集的度量資料指定的來源類型名稱。 \\\n"
"此設定預設為 mcollect_stash。系統不會為 \\\n"
"以 mcollect_stash 來源類型索引的資料計算授權用量。如果您變更為不同的 \\\n"
"來源類型，則 Splunk 平台會為由 meventcollect 命令索引的任何資料 \\\n"
"計算授權用量。注意: 若無 Splunk 專業服務或 Splunk 支援人員從旁協助， \\\n"
"請勿變更此設定。若變更來源類型，則必須變更 \\\n"
"props.conf 檔案。 \\\n"
"「field-list」: 維度欄位清單。如果 split=false (預設值)，則為選擇性， \\\n"
"如果 split=true，則為必要。如果未指定「field-list」，則會將所有的欄位視為資料點 (「field-list」除外)  \\\n"
"與內部欄位 (字首加上底線 \\\n"
"「_」的欄位) 的維度。如果有指定「field-list」，則必須在 mcollect 命令引數的結尾 \\\n"
"指定清單。如果有指定「field-list」，則會將所有的 \\\n"
"欄位視為度量值，但「field-list」、 \\\n"
"「prefix-field」及內部欄位中的欄位除外。 \\\n"
"每個度量值的名稱皆為字首加上「prefix-field」值的欄位名稱。 \\\n"
"實際上，系統會為每個包含數值的合格欄位傳回一個度量資料點。 \\\n"
"如果一個搜尋結果包含多個合格的 \\\n"
"度量名稱/值配對，則系統會將結果分割至多個度量資料點。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4558 
msgid ""
"Converts search results into metric data and inserts the data into a "
"metric index \\\n"
"on the search head. If each result contains only one metric_name field \\"
"\n"
"and one numeric _value field, the result is already a normalized metrics "
"data point, \\\n"
"the result does not need to be split and can be consumed directly. \\\n"
"Otherwise, each result is spit into multiple metric data points based on "
"the specified \\\n"
"list of dimension fields. \\\n"
"If the '_time' field is present in the results, it is used as the "
"timestamp of the \\\n"
"metric datapoint. If the '_time' field is not present, the current time "
"is used. \\\n"
"Arguments: \\\n"
"“index”: The index where the collected metric data are placed. This "
"argument is required. \\\n"
"“file”: The file name where you want the collected metrics data to be "
"written. \\\n"
"The default file name is a random filename. You can use a timestamp or a "
"random number \\\n"
"for the file name by specifying either file=$timestamp$ or file=$random$."
" \\\n"
"Defaults to $random$_metrics.csv \\\n"
"“split”: Determines how mcollect identifies the measures in an event. "
"Defaults to false. \\\n"
"When split=true, you use <field-list> to identify the dimensions in your "
"search. The  \\\n"
"mcollect command converts any field in your search that is not part of "
"the <field-list> \\\n"
"into a measurement. \\\n"
"When split=false, the measure field or fields need to be explicitly "
"specified by the \\\n"
"search. \\\n"
"* If you have single-metric events, the search must produce results with "
"a \\\n"
"'metric_name' field for the name of the measure and a '_value' field for "
"the \\\n"
"measure's numeric value. \\\n"
"* If you have multiple-metric events, the search must produce results "
"that include \\\n"
"measures that follow this syntax: "
"'metric_name:<metric_name>=<numeric_value>'. \\\n"
"When split=allnums, mcollect treats all numeric fields as metric measures"
" and all \\\n"
"non-numeric fields as dimensions. You can optionally use <field-list> to "
"declare that \\\n"
"certain numeric fields in the events should be treated as dimensions. \\\n"
"“spool”: If spool=true (which is the default setting), the metrics data "
"file is written \\\n"
"to the Splunk spool directory, $SPLUNK_HOME/var/spool/splunk, where the "
"file is indexed \\\n"
"automatically. If spool=false, the file is written to the "
"$SPLUNK_HOME/var/run/splunk/collect \\\n"
"directory. The file remains in this directory unless some form of further"
" automation \\\n"
"or administration is done. \\\n"
"“prefix_field”: Is applicable only when split=true. If specified, any "
"event with that \\\n"
"field missing is ignored. Otherwise, the field value is prefixed to the "
"metric name. \\\n"
"\"host\": The name of the host that you want to specify for the collected"
" metrics data. \\\n"
"Only applicable when spool=true. \\\n"
"\"source\": The name of the source that you want to specify for the "
"collected metrics data. \\\n"
"Defaults to the name of search. \\\n"
"\"sourcetype\": The name of the source type that is specified for the "
"collected metrics \\\n"
"data. This setting defaults to mcollect_stash. License usage is not "
"calculated for \\\n"
"data indexed with the mcollect_stash source type. If you change to a "
"different \\\n"
"source type, the Splunk platform calculates license usage for any data "
"indexed \\\n"
"by the mcollect command. NOTE: Do not change this setting without \\\n"
"assistance from Splunk Professional Services or Splunk Support. Changing "
"the \\\n"
"source type requires a change to the props.conf file. \\\n"
"“marker”: Optional. A string of one or more comma-separated key-value "
"pairs. The Splunk \\\n"
"software adds these key-value pairs to the metric data points in the "
"summary \\\n"
"metric index, so you can use them as markers for easy identification in "
"future \\\n"
"searches of the metric index where they reside. Defaults to empty. \\\n"
"“field-list”: A list of dimension fields. Optional if split=false (the "
"default), required \\\n"
"if split=true. If “field-list” is not specified, all fields are treated "
"as dimensions \\\n"
"for the data point except for the “prefix_field” and internal fields "
"(fields with an \\\n"
"underscore ’_’ prefix). If “field-list” is specified, the list must be "
"specified \\\n"
"at the end of the mcollect command arguments.  If “field-list” is "
"specified, all \\\n"
"fields are treated as metric values, except for fields in “field-list”, "
"\\\n"
"the “prefix-field”, and internal fields. \\\n"
"The name of each metric value is the field name prefixed with the "
"”prefix_field” value. \\\n"
"Effectively, one metric data point is returned for each qualifying field "
"that \\\n"
"contains a numerical value. If one search result contains multiple "
"qualifying \\\n"
"metric name/value pairs, the result is split into multiple metric data "
"points."
msgstr ""
"將搜尋結果轉換為度量資料，並將資料插入到搜尋頭端點上的 \\\n"
"度量索引。如果每個結果只包含一個 metric_name 欄位與一個 \\\n"
"numeric _value 欄位，則結果已經是正常化的度量資料點， \\\n"
"且結果不需要被分割並可直接取用 \\\n"
"否則，會根據指定的維度欄位清單，將每個結果分割成 \\\n"
"多個度量資料點。 \\\n"
"如果「_time」欄位出現在結果中，將作為度量資料點的 \\\n"
"時間戳記。如果「_time」欄位未出現，將使用目前時間。 \\\n"
"引數:  \\\n"
"「index」: 所收集度量資料所在的索引。此引數為必要。 \\\n"
"「file」: 要將收集的度量資料寫入的檔案名稱。 \\\n"
"預設檔案名稱是隨機的檔案名稱。您可以指定 file=$timestamp$ 或 file=$random$，\\\n"
"對於檔案名稱使用時間戳記或隨機數字。 \\\n"
"預設為 $random$_metrics.csv \\\n"
"「split」: 決定 mcollect 如何識別事件中的測量。預設為 false。 \\\n"
"split=true 時，可以使用 <field-list> 識別搜尋中的維度。 \\\n"
"mcollect 命令會將不屬於 <field-list> 的搜尋中出現的任何欄位轉換 \\\n"
"為測量。 \\\n"
"split=false 時，一個或多個測量欄位需要由 \\\n"
"搜尋明確指定。 \\\n"
"* 如果有單一度量事件，搜尋必須產生有 \\\n"
"測量名稱的「metric_name」欄位和測量數值的「_value」欄位 \\\n"
"在其中的結果。 \\\n"
"* 如果有多重度量事件，搜尋必須產生包含 \\\n"
"語法為「metric_name:<metric_name>=<numeric_value>」的測量在其中的結果。 \\\n"
"split=allnums 時，mcollect 會將全部數值欄位視為數值測量，並且將全部 \\\n"
"非數值欄位視為維度。您可以選擇使用 <field-list> 宣告 \\\n"
"應該將事件中的特定數值欄位視為維度。 \\\n"
"「spool」: 如果 spool=true (此為預設設定)，則會將度量資料檔案寫入 \\\n"
"Splunk spool 目錄，$SPLUNK_HOME/var/spool/splunk，在此會自動索引檔案。 \\\n"
"如果 spool=false，則檔案會寫入 $SPLUNK_HOME/var/run/splunk/collect \\\n"
"目錄。檔案會保留在此目錄中，除非有某種的進一步自動化 \\\n"
"或管理完成。 \\\n"
"「prefix_field」: 僅適用於 split=true 時。若有指定，則會忽略任何缺少 \\\n"
"該欄位的事件。否則，會在度量名稱前加上欄位值。 \\\n"
"「host」: 您要為所收集度量資料指定的主機名稱。 \\\n"
"僅適用於 spool=true。 \\\n"
"「source」: 您想要為所收集度量資料指定的來源名稱。 \\\n"
"預設為搜尋名稱。 \\\n"
"「sourcetype」: 為所收集的度量資料指定的來源類型名稱。 \\\n"
"此設定預設為 mcollect_stash。系統不會為 \\\n"
"以 mcollect_stash 來源類型索引的資料計算授權用量。如果您變更為不同的 \\\n"
"來源類型，則 Splunk 平台會為由 mcollect 命令索引的任何資料 \\\n"
"計算授權用量。注意: 若無 Splunk 專業服務或 Splunk 支援人員從旁協助， \\\n"
"請勿變更此設定。若變更來源類型，則必須變更 \\\n"
"props.conf 檔案。 \\\n"
"「marker」: 選用。一個或多個逗號分隔的鍵值配對組成的字串。Splunk \\\n"
"軟體會將這些鍵值配對新增至摘要中的 \\\n"
"度量資料點，以供您可以使用這些作為標記，便於日後搜尋 \\\n"
"所在的度量索引時進行識別之用。預設為空白。 \\\n"
"「field-list」: 維度欄位清單。如果 split=false (預設值)，則為選擇性， \\\n"
"如果 split=true，則為必要。如果未指定「field-list」，則會將所有的欄位視為資料點 (「field-list」除外)  \\\n"
"與內部欄位 (字首加上底線 \\\n"
"「_」的欄位) 的維度。如果有指定「field-list」，則必須在 mcollect 命令引數的結尾 \\\n"
"指定清單。如果有指定「field-list」，則會將所有的 \\\n"
"欄位視為度量值，但「field-list」、 \\\n"
"「prefix-field」及內部欄位中的欄位除外。 \\\n"
"每個度量值的名稱皆為字首加上「prefix-field」值的欄位名稱。 \\\n"
"實際上，系統會為每個包含數值的合格欄位傳回一個度量資料點。 \\\n"
"如果一個搜尋結果包含多個合格的 \\\n"
"度量名稱/值配對，則系統會將結果分割至多個度量資料點。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:935 
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Converts the values of fields into numerical values. When renaming a "
"field using \"as\", the original field is left intact. The timeformat "
"option is used by ctime and mktime conversions.  Default = \"%m/%d/%Y "
"%H:%M:%S\"."
msgstr "將欄位的值轉換為數值。使用 [as] 重新命名欄位時，原始欄位會保持不變。ctime 和 mktime 轉換會使用 timeformat 選項。預設 = \"%m/%d/%Y %H:%M:%S\"。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3044 
