"系統會對每個表格列建立新的事件，並從表格的標題列衍生出欄位名稱。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2512 
msgid ""
"Extracts key/value pairs from events based on a form\\\n"
"template that describes how to extract the values.  If FORM is "
"specified,\\\n"
"it uses an installed <FORM>.form file found in the splunk configuration "
"form directory.\\\n"
"For example, if \"form=sales_order\", would look for a "
"\"sales_order.form\"\\\n"
"file in the 'forms' subdirectory in all apps, e.g. "
"$SPLUNK_HOME$/etc/apps/*/forms/.  \\\n"
"All the events processed would\\\n"
"be matched against that form, trying to extract values.\\p\\\\\n"
"If no FORM is specified, then the FIELD value determines the name of the "
"field to\\\n"
"extract.  For example, if \"field=error_code\", then an event that has an"
" error_code=404,\\\n"
"would be matched against a \"404.form\" file.\\p\\\\\n"
"The default value for FIELD is \"sourcetype\", thus by default kvform "
"will look for \\\n"
"<SOURCETYPE>.form files to extract values.\\p\\\\\n"
"A .form file is essentially a text file or all static parts of a form, \\"
"\n"
"interspersed with named references to regular expressions, of the type "
"found in\\\n"
"transforms.conf.  A .form might might look like this:\\i\\\\\n"
"Students Name: [[string:student_name]] \\i\\\\\n"
"Age: [[int:age]] Zip: [[int:zip]] ."
msgstr ""
"根據描述如何擷取值的表單\\\n"
"範本，從事件擷取 [鍵/值] 配對。若指定了表單，\\\n"
"會使用 splunk 設定表單目錄所找到、已安裝的 <FORM>.form 檔案。\\\n"
"例如，若 [form=sales_order]，會在在所有應用套件中「forms」子目錄中尋找 [sales_order.form]\\\n"
"檔案，例如 $SPLUNK_HOME$/etc/apps/.../form 中。會使用該表單\\\n"
"比對處理過的所有事件，試著擷取值。\\p\\\\\n"
"若未指定 FORM，FIELD 值會決定要\\\n"
"擷取的欄位名稱。例如，若 [field=error_code]，則會對照 [404.form] 檔案比對具有 error_code=404 \\\n"
"的事件。\\p\\\\\n"
"FIELD 的預設值是 [sourcetype]，因此依照預設，kvform 會尋找 \\\n"
"<SOURCETYPE>.form 檔案以擷取值。\\p\\\\\n"
".form 檔案本質上是文字檔案或表單的所有靜態部份，\\\n"
"穿插對 transforms.conf 中類型的規則運算式之\\\n"
"具名參照。.form 外觀會類似這樣:\\i\\\\\n"
"學生名稱:[[string:student_name]] \\i\\\\\n"
"年齡:[[int:age]] 郵遞區號:[[int:zip]]。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6208 
msgid "Extracts location information from IP addresses using 3rd-party databases."
msgstr "使用第三方資料庫，從 IP 位址擷取位置資訊。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1294 
msgid ""
"Extracts out values like \"7/01\" and \"7/02\", but not patterns like "
"\"99/2\", putting extractions into the \"monthday\" attribute."
msgstr "擷取類似 \"7/01\" 和 \"7/02\" 這樣的值，但樣式不得類似 \"99/2\"，並將擷取結果放入 [monthday] 屬性中。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1292 
msgid ""
"Extracts out values like \"7/01\", putting them into the \"monthday\" "
"attribute."
msgstr "擷取類似 \"7/01\" 這樣的值，放入 [monthday] 屬性中。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1537 
msgid ""
"Extracts the value 1 from the key \"john.smith\" in the provided JSON "
"object. The function treats the character \".\" in \"john.smith\" as a "
"string literal, as opposed to a nested object in JSON format."
msgstr "在提供的 JSON 物件中，從索引鍵「john.smith」擷取值 1。函數會將「john.smith」中的字元「.」作為字串常值處理，而非作為 JSON 格式的巢狀物件處理。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6191 
msgid "Extracts the xpath value from FIELD and sets the OUTFIELD attribute."
msgstr "從 FIELD 擷取 xpath 值，並設定 OUTFIELD 屬性。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2495 
msgid "Extracts values from search results, using a form template."
msgstr "使用表單範本，從搜尋結果擷取值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3935 
msgid ""
"Extracts values from structured data (XML or JSON) and stores them in a "
"field or fields."
msgstr "從結構化資料 (XML 或 JSON) 擷取值，並儲存於欄位中。"

