#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/WinEventLogsWMI.js:177 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/WinPerfmonLocal.js:421 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/WinPerfmonRemote.js:263 
msgid ""
"If possible, use a universal forwarder rather than WMI to collect data "
"from remote machines. The resource load of WMI can exceed that of a "
"Splunk universal forwarder in many cases. In particular, consider a "
"forwarder if you collect multiple event logs or performance counters from"
" each host, or from very busy hosts like domain controllers. "
msgstr "如果可行，請使用通用轉送器而非 WMI 來收集遠端電腦的資料。在許多情況下，WMI 的資源負載可能超過 Splunk 通用轉送器。請特別注意，如果您從每一部主機，或從極忙碌的主機 (如網域控制器) 收集多個事件記錄檔或效能計數器，請考慮使用轉送器。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4395 
msgid ""
"If set to \"hec\", outputs a HEC JSON formatted output, which allows all "
"fields to be \\\n"
"automatically indexed when the stash file is indexed.  HEC formatted "
"stash files \\\n"
"will end with a .stash_hec suffix instead of .stash.  \\\n"
"If set to \"raw\", uses the traditional non-structured log style \\\n"
"summary indexing stash output format.  Default is \"raw\"."
msgstr "如果設定為「hec」，將輸出 HEC JSON 格式的輸出，允許在索引 stash 檔案時自動索引全部欄位。HEC 格式的 stash 檔案將以. stash_hec 字尾而非. stash 字尾為結尾。如果設定為「原始」，將使用傳統的非結構化日誌樣式摘要索引 stash 輸出格式。預設值為「原始」。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4402 
msgid ""
"If set to true (default is true), the summary indexing file will be "
"written to \\\n"
"Splunk's spool directory, where it will be indexed automatically. \\\n"
"If set to false, the file is written to "
"$SPLUNK_HOME/var/run/splunk/collect, where it will remain \\\n"
"until further administrative actions are taken."
msgstr ""
"若設為 true (預設為 true)，檢索檔案的摘要會被寫入 \\\n"
"Splunk 的 spool 目錄，在此被自動檢索。\\\n"
"若設為 false，檔案會被寫入 $SPLUNK_HOME/var/run/splunk/collect，維持在此處，值到採取進一步管理行動。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2829 
msgid ""
"If set to true the results will contain fields for the splunk_server "
"aplunk_server_group and _time when they were created \\\n"
"These may be used to compute aggregates etc. Certain order sensitive "
"processors may also fail if the internal _time field is absent. \\\n"
"False by default."
msgstr ""
"若設為 true，則結果將包含建立結果時的 splunk_server aplunk_server_group 與 _time 的欄位 \\\n"
"這些欄位可用於計算彙總等等。若內部 _time 欄位不存在，則某些順序敏感處理器也可能會失敗。\\\n"
"預設為 false。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3877 
msgid ""
"If set to true, no error is thrown, if email sending fails and thus the "
"search pipeline continues execution as if sendemail was not there."
