#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2054 
msgid ""
"If true, geostats produces one result per each binned location for "
"rendering on a \\\n"
"map.  If false, geostats produces one result per category per binned "
"location and \\\n"
"cannot be rendered on a map. Defaults to true."
msgstr "若為 true，則 geostats 針對每個地圖上的索引分集地點產生一結果。若為 false，則 geostats 針對每個索引分集地點之類別產生一結果且無法於地圖上轉譯。預設為 true。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3723 
msgid "If true, no string substitution replacements are made."
msgstr "若為 true，不會執行字串替換。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4376 
msgid ""
"If true, will write the search time and time bounds into the text \\\n"
"out of each summary index event in the format \\\n"
"info_min_time=<search_earliest_time>, info_max_time=<search_latest_time>,"
" \\\n"
"info_search_time=<search_exec_time>.  Defaults to true for "
"output_format=raw"
msgstr ""
"若為 true，會將搜尋時間與時間範圍寫入\\\n"
"各摘要索引事件中的文字，格式為 \\\n"
"info_min_time=<search_earliest_time>、info_max_time=<search_latest_time>、\\\n"
"info_search_time=<search_exec_time>。對於 output_format=raw，預設為 true"

