#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:888 
msgid ""
"In statistics, contingency tables are used to record \\\n"
"and analyze the relationship between two or more (usually categorical) "
"variables.  Many metrics of \\\n"
"association or independence can be calculated based on contingency "
"tables, such as the phi \\\n"
"coefficient or the V of Cramer."
msgstr ""
"在統計學中，列聯表用來記錄\\\n"
"和分析二或多個 (通常為類別) 變數之間的關係。相關性或獨立性的許多衡量標準\\\n"
"都可根據列聯表計算得出，如 phi \\\n"
" (相關) 係數或 Cramer 的 V 係數。"

