#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/WinEventLogsLocal.js:97 
msgid ""
"It depends on how you installed the Splunk platform instance. If you "
"installed it as the \"Local System\" user, it has access to all event "
"logs on the local machine. If you installed it as a domain user, it has "
"access to only the event logs that you give that user access to, on "
"either local or remote Windows machines."
msgstr "這取決於您安裝 Splunk 平台執行個體的方式。如果您以 [本機系統] 使用者的身分安裝 Splunk 平台，Splunk 平台即具備本機電腦上所有事件記錄檔的存取權。如果以網域使用者身分安裝 Splunk 平台，則 Splunk 平台僅具備您在本機或遠端 Windows 電腦上，提供給該使用者的事件記錄檔存取權。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/Script.js:363 
msgid ""
"It depends on the operating system that this machine runs. If it runs a "
"*nix OS, you can create and run shell scripts or binaries that send text "
"output to the stdout or stderr output channels. If it runs Windows, you "
"can deploy batch files or PowerShell scripts. You can create and use "
"scripts to get data from APIs. You can also use a wrapper to execute a "
"script that the Splunk platform would not otherwise support. "
msgstr "這取決於這部電腦執行的作業系統。如果它執行 *nix 作業系統，您可以建立和執行可將文字輸出傳送至 stdout 或 stderr 輸出管道的 shell 指令碼或二進位檔。如果執行 Windows，您可以部署批次檔或 PowerShell 指令碼。您可以建立和使用指令碼來取得 API 的資料。您也可以使用包裝函式來執行 Splunk 平台不支援的指令碼。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/add_data/input_forms/WinRegmon.js:130 
msgid ""
"It depends. A domain user can read many Registry items, but only local "
"administrators can access some security-related items. If you install the"
" Splunk platform as the Local System user, it can read all Registry items"
" on the local machine."
msgstr "視情況而定。網域使用者可讀取許多登錄項目，但只有本機管理員可存取某些安全性相關項目。如果您以本機系統使用者身分安裝 Splunk 平台，則可在本機電腦上讀取所有登錄項目。"

