msgid ""
"Manually invokes field value lookups from an existing lookup table or "
"external \\\n"
"script. Lookup tables must be located in the lookups directory of \\\n"
"$SPLUNK_HOME/etc/system/lookups or $SPLUNK_HOME/etc/apps/<app-"
"name>/lookups. \\\n"
"External scripts must be located in "
"$SPLUNK_HOME/etc/apps/<app_name>/bin.\\p\\\\\n"
"Specify a lookup field to match to a field in the events and, optionally,"
" \\\n"
"destination fields to add to the events. If you do not specify "
"destination fields, \\\n"
"adds all fields in the lookup table to events that have the match field. "
"You can \\\n"
"also overwrite fields in the events with fields in the lookup table, if "
"they have \\\n"
"the same field name."
msgstr ""
"從現有查閱表手動叫用欄位值查閱或外部指令碼。查閱表必須位於\\\n"
"$SPLUNK_HOME/etc/system/lookups 或 $SPLUNK_HOME/etc/apps/<app-name>/lookups 之查閱目錄\\\n"
"外部指令碼必須位於 $SPLUNK_HOME/etc/apps/<app_name>/bin.\\p\\\\\n"
"指定一查閱欄位以吻合事件中之欄位及 (選擇性地) 要新增至事件之目的地欄位。若您不指定目的地欄位，將所有查閱表中的欄位新增至有吻合欄位之事件。若有相同欄位名稱，您亦可用查閱表中的欄位覆蓋事件中之欄位。"

