#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6482 
msgid ""
"Retrieves events matching the transactiontype\\\n"
"TRANSACTION-NAME with events transitively discovered by the initial\\\n"
"event constraint of the SEARCH-STRING.  \\p\\\\\n"
"For example, given an 'email'\\\n"
"transactiontype with fields=\"qid pid\" and with a search attribute of\\\n"
"'sourcetype=\"sendmail_syslog\"', and a SEARCH-STRING of \"to=root\", "
"searchtxn will\\\n"
"find all the events that match 'sourcetype=\"sendmail_syslog\" "
"to=root'.\\p\\\\\n"
"From those results, all the qid's and pid's are transitively used to\\\n"
"find further search for relevant events. When no more qid or pid\\\n"
"values are found, the resulting search is run\\i\\\\\n"
"'sourcetype=\"sendmail_syslog\" ((qid=val1 pid=val1) OR ...\\\n"
"....(qid=valn pid=valm) | transaction name=email | search "
"to=root'.\\p\\\\\n"
"Options:\\p\\\\\n"
"max_terms -- integer between 1-1000 which determines how many unique "
"field values all fields can use (default=1000).  Using smaller values "
"will speed up search, favoring more recent values\\p\\\\\n"
"use_disjunct -- determines if each term in SEARCH-STRING should be OR'd "
"on the initial search (default=true)\\p\\\\\n"
"eventsonly -- if true, only the relevant events are retrieved, but the "
"\"|transaction\" command is not run (default=false)"
msgstr ""
"以 SEARCH-STRING 初始\\\n"
"事件限制式轉換性探索到的事件，抓取符合交易類型\\\n"
"TRANSACTION-NAME 的事件。\\p\\\\\n"
"例如，提供欄位=[qid pid]、搜尋屬性為\\\n"
"[sourcetype=\"sendmail_syslog\"] 且 SEARCH-STRING 為 [to=root] 的 [電子郵件]\\\n"
"transactiontype，searchtxn 會\\\n"
"尋找符合 [sourcetype=\"sendmail_syslog\" to=root] 的所有事件。\\p\\\\\n"
"在這些結果中的所有 qid 和 pid，都會轉換性的用來\\\n"
"尋找相關事件的進一步搜尋。若未找到更多 qid 或 pid\\\n"
"值，會執行結果搜尋\\i\\\\\n"
"'sourcetype=\"sendmail_syslog\" ((qid=val1 pid=val1) OR ...\\\n"
"....(qid=valn pid=valm) | transaction name=email | search to=root'.\\p\\\\\n"
"選項:\\p\\\\\n"
"max_terms -- 1-1000 間的整數，決定所有欄位可用多少唯一欄位值 (預設=1000)。使用較小值會加速搜尋，有利於較近期的值\\p\\\\\n"
"use_disjunct -- 決定 SEARCH-STRING 中的各詞彙是否應於初始搜尋中加入 OR (預設=true)\\p\\\\\n"
"eventsonly -- 若為 true，僅會抓取相關事件，但不會執行 [|transaction] 命令 (預設=false)"

