msgid "Return the least common values of the \"url\" field."
msgstr "傳回 [url] 欄位最不常見的值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:802 
msgid ""
"Return the maximum delay for each value in the 'site' field split by the "
"value in the 'org' field."
msgstr "傳回 [site] 欄位中的每個值除以 [org] 欄位中的值的延遲最大值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6378 
msgid "Return the number of events in the '_internal' index."
msgstr "傳回 [_internal] 索引中的事件數。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:808 
msgid ""
"Return the ratio of the average (mean) \"size\" to the maximum \"delay\" "
"for each distinct \"host\" and \"user\" pair."
msgstr "對各個明確 [host] 與 [user] 配對，傳回平均 (平均值)「size」對最大「delay」的比率。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:806 
msgid ""
"Return the the maximum \"delay\" by \"size\", where \"size\" is broken "
"down into a maximum of 10 equal sized buckets."
msgstr "依「size」傳回最大「delay」，其中「size」會細分為最多 10 個大小相等的索引分集。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6341 
msgid "Return the values of \"host\" for data points in the \"mymetrics\" index."
msgstr "傳回「mymetrics」索引中資料點的「host」值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6334 
msgid "Return the values of \"host\" for events in the \"_internal\" index."
msgstr "傳回 [_internal] 索引中事件的 [host] 值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6343 
msgid "Return the values of \"source\" for data points in all metrics indexes."
msgstr "傳回所有度量索引中資料點的「source」值。"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/pivot/errors/ErrorDisplay.js:130 
msgid "Return to Search"
msgstr "傳回搜尋"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/table/modals/AdvancedEditorReturn.js:20 
msgid "Return to Simple Editor"
msgstr "傳回簡易編輯器"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/account/status/Master.html:1 
msgid "Return to Splunk"
msgstr "返回 Splunk"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web_v2/search_mrsparkle/exposed/js/views/table/commandeditor/editorforms/Base.js:511 
msgid "Return to simple editor"
msgstr "傳回簡易編輯器"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5343 
msgid "Return top \"user\" values for each \"host\"."
msgstr "對各 [host] 傳回最高的 [user] 值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5341 
msgid "Return top URL values."
msgstr "傳回最高的 URL 值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5902 
msgid "Return typeahead information for sources in the \"_internal\" index."
msgstr "傳回 [_internal] 索引中來源的 typeahead 資訊。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4225 
msgid ""
"Return values of \"URL\" that contain the string \"404\" or \"303\" but "
"not both."
msgstr "傳回僅包含字串 [404] 或 [303] (不得同時包含兩者) 的 [URL] 值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6338 
msgid ""
"Return values of \"sourcetype\" for events in the \"_audit\" index on any"
" server name that begins with \"peer\"."
msgstr "傳回任何以「peer」起始的伺服器名稱上「_audit」索引中事件的「sourcetype」值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6336 
msgid ""
"Return values of \"sourcetype\" for events in the \"_audit\" index on "
"server peer01"
msgstr "傳回伺服器 peer01 上 [_audit] 索引中事件的 [sourcetype] 值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1551 
msgid ""
"Returns \"true\" if \"inventory\" can be parsed as JSON. Otherwise, the "
"function returns \"false\"."
msgstr "若「inventory」可剖析為 JSON 則傳回 True。否則函數會傳回 False。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6572 
msgid ""
"Returns 100 metric time series worth of metric data points in batches "
"from TSIDX files belonging to the _metrics index."
msgstr "從屬於 _metrics 索引的 TSIDX 檔案中批量傳回 100 個度量時間系列的度量資料點。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1605 
msgid ""
"Returns a JSON array of JSON objects with the fields \"key\" and "
"\"value\" that represent the fields of the JSON object in \"field\"."
msgstr "傳回 JSON 物件的 JSON 陣列，其中的 [key] 和 [value] 欄位代表 [field] 中 JSON 物件的欄位。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1324 
msgid "Returns a description for the corresponding http status code."
msgstr "傳回相對應 http 狀態碼的說明。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2187 
msgid "Returns a history of searches as a table"
msgstr "以表格形式傳回搜尋的歷程記錄。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2182 
msgid ""
"Returns a history of searches, either as events or as non-event results "
"(default)."
msgstr "以事件或非事件結果 (預設) 形式，傳回搜尋的歷程記錄。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6332 
msgid "Returns a list of source, sourcetypes, or hosts."
msgstr "傳回來源、來源類型或主機的清單。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6495 
msgid "Returns a list of terms from the tsidx lexicon of each event index bucket"
msgstr "傳回每個事件索引中索引分集的 tsidx 字庫詞彙清單"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6530 
msgid ""
"Returns a list of the individual metric data points in a specified metric"
" index that match a provided filter"
msgstr "傳回指定指標索引中與提供的篩選相符的單一指標資料點清單"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2527 
msgid "Returns a list of time ranges in which the search results were found."
msgstr "傳回找到搜尋結果的時間範圍清單。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3961 
msgid "Returns a table formed by only the fields specified in the arguments."
msgstr "回傳僅由引數指定之欄位產生之表格。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:3964 
msgid ""
"Returns a table formed by only the fields specified in the arguments. "
"Columns are \\\n"
"displayed in the same order that fields are specified. Column headers are"
" the field \\\n"
"names. Rows are the field values. Each row represents an event."
msgstr "回傳僅由引數指定之欄位產生之表格。欄以欄位指定之相同之順序顯示。欄標頭為欄位名稱。列為欄位值。每列代表一事件。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6509 
msgid ""
"Returns all indexed field terms ending with \"bar\" in the \"_internal\" "
"index, per bucket."
msgstr "根據每個索引分集傳回「_internal\\」索引中以「bar」結尾的索引欄位詞彙。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6505 
msgid ""
"Returns all terms in each bucket of the \"_internal\" index and find the "
"total count for each term"
msgstr "傳回「_internal\\」索引中每個索引分集的所有詞彙，並尋找每個詞彙的總數"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6507 
msgid ""
"Returns all terms starting with \"foo\" in each bucket of the "
"\"_internal\" and \"_audit\" indexes."
msgstr "傳回「_internal\\」和「_audit\\」索引之每個索引分集中以「foo」開頭的所有詞彙。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:768 
msgid ""
"Returns at most MAXCOUNT events by taking the incoming events and rolling"
" up multiple sources into directories, by preferring directories that "
"have many files but few events.  The field with the path is PATHFIELD "
"(e.g., source), and strings are broken up by a SEP character.  The "
"default pathfield=source; sizefield=totalCount; maxcount=20; "
"countfield=totalCount; sep=\"/\" or \"\\\\\", depending on the os."
msgstr "抓取傳入事件，並提拔具有許多檔案但僅有少數事件的目錄，將多來源縮合至目錄，以傳回最多 MAXCOUNT 個事件。具有路徑的欄位為 PATHFIELD (如 source)，而字串會被 SEP 字元斷開。根據作業系統，預設 pathfield=source、sizefield=totalCount、maxcount=20、countfield=totalCount、sep=[/] 或 [\\\\]。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5992 
msgid ""
"Returns both the 'info' and 'group' event types in the 'eventtype' field "
"for events matching those event types."
msgstr "對於符合這些事件類型的事件，在「eventtype」欄位中同時傳回「info」和「group」事件類型。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4951 
msgid ""
"Returns epoch time of the chronologically latest seen occurrence of a "
"value of the field."
msgstr "傳回依照時間順序最晚看到該欄位出現之值的 epoch 時間。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5990 
msgid ""
"Returns event types beginning with the string 'doc' in the 'eventtype' "
"field for events matching the event type."
msgstr "對於符合事件類型的事件，在「eventtype」欄位中傳回以字串「doc」開頭的事件類型。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6568 
msgid ""
"Returns individual data points from the _metrics index that match the "
"specified filter."
msgstr "從符合指定篩選的 _metrics 索引傳回個別資料點。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6570 
msgid "Returns individual data points from the _metrics index."
msgstr "從 _metrics 索引傳回個別資料點。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2186 
msgid ""
"Returns information about searches that the current user has run.  \\\n"
"By default, the search strings are presented as a field called "
"\"search\". \\\n"
"If events=true, then the search strings are presented as the text of the "
"\\\n"
"events, as the _raw field."
msgstr ""
"回傳關於目前使用者已執行之搜尋之資訊。\\\n"
"根據預設，搜尋字串以名為「search」之欄位呈現。\\\n"
"若 events=true，則搜尋字串以事件之文字呈現，如 _raw 欄位。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2200 
msgid "Returns information about the buckets in the Splunk Enterprise index."
msgstr "在 Splunk Enterprise 索引中傳回索引分集的相關資訊。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2211 
msgid ""
"Returns information about the buckets in the Splunk Enterprise index. \\\n"
"The Splunk Enterprise index is the repository for data from Splunk "
"Enterprise. \\\n"
"As incoming data is indexed, or transformed into events, Splunk "
"Enterprise \\\n"
"creates files of rawdata and metadata (index files). The files reside in "
"sets \\\n"
"of directories organized by age. These directories are called buckets. \\"
"\n"
"When invoked without the bin-span option, information about the buckets "
"\\\n"
"is returned in the following fields: \\\n"
"bucketId, endEpoch, eventCount, guID, hostCount, id, index, modTime, "
"path, \\\n"
"rawSize, sizeOnDiskMB, sourceCount, sourceTypeCount, splunk_server, "
"startEpoch, state, \\\n"
"corruptReason. The corruptReason field only appears when "
"corruptonly=true. \\p\\\\\n"
"When invoked with a bin span, a table of the spans of each bucket is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"在 Splunk Enterprise 索引中傳回索引分集的相關資訊。 \\\n"
"Splunk Enterprise 索引是 Splunk Enterprise 中資料的儲存庫。 \\\n"
"在編製輸入資料的索引時，或將輸入資料轉換成事件時，Splunk Enterprise \\\n"
"會建立原始資料與中繼資料 (索引檔案) 的檔案。這些檔案位在依資齡組織的 \\\n"
"目錄集中。這些目錄稱做索引分集。 \\\n"
"當未經由 bin 跨距選項叫用時，系統會在下列欄位中 \\\n"
"傳回索引分集的相關資訊: \\\n"
"bucketId、endEpoch、eventCount、guID、hostCount、id、index、modTime、path、\\\n"
"rawSize、sizeOnDiskMB、sourceCount、sourceTypeCount、splunk_server、startEpoch、state、\\\n"
"corruptReason。corruptReason 欄位只有在 corruptonly=true 時才會顯示。 \\p\\\\\n"
"當經由 bin 跨距叫用時，則會傳回每個索引分集的跨距表。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:785 
msgid "Returns results in a tabular output for charting."
msgstr "以表格輸出傳回結果以製作圖表。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6266 
msgid ""
"Returns statistics about the raw field that might be useful for "
"filtering/classifying events."
msgstr "傳回可能對篩選/分類事件而言非常實用的原始欄位相關統計資料。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6265 
msgid "Returns statistics about the raw field."
msgstr "傳回原始欄位的相關統計資料。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1697 
msgid ""
"Returns summaries for only fields that start with date_ and return only "
"the top 10 values for each field"
msgstr "僅傳回以 date_ 開頭欄位的摘要，並僅傳回每個欄位的前 10 個值"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1607 
msgid ""
"Returns that the key \"john.smith\" exists in the provided JSON object. "
"The function treats the character \".\" in \"john.smith\" as a string "
"literal, as opposed to a nested object in JSON format."
msgstr ""
"傳回所提供的 JSON 物件中存在索引鍵 \"john.smith\"。此函數會將 \"john.smith\" 中的字元 \".\" 視為字串常值，而非 JSON 格式的巢狀物件。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5988 
msgid ""
"Returns the 'info' event type in the 'eventtype' field for events "
"matching the eventtype."
msgstr "對於符合這些事件類型的事件，在「eventtype」欄位中傳回「info」事件類型。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5570 
msgid ""
"Returns the average across the individual time series rates.  Requires at"
" least one rate value of the field to calculate the rate average. Valid "
"for mstats only."
msgstr "傳回個別時間系列速率的平均。需要至少一個欄位的速率值才能計算速率平均。僅對 mstats 有效。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5698 
msgid ""
"Returns the average of field foo in mydata where bar is specifically "
"'value2' and the value of baz is greater than 5."
msgstr "在 mydata 中傳回欄位 foo 的平均，其中長條特別為 [value2]，且 baz 的值大於 5。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4929 
msgid ""
"Returns the chronologically earliest seen occurrence of a value of the "
"field."
msgstr "傳回依照時間順序最早看到該欄位出現的值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4947 
msgid ""
"Returns the chronologically latest seen occurrence of a value of the "
"field."
msgstr "傳回依照時間順序最晚看到該欄位出現的值。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1465 
msgid ""
"Returns the current wall-clock time with microsecond resolution.  Will be"
" different for each event based on when that event was processed by eval."
msgstr "傳回以毫秒解析度表示的目前時鐘時間。根據 eval 處理事件的時間，各事件的結果都會不同。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1242 
msgid "Returns the difference between two search results."
msgstr "傳回兩搜尋結果之間的差異。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4933 
msgid ""
"Returns the epoch time of the chronologically earliest seen occurrence of"
" a value of the field."
msgstr "傳回依照時間順序最早看到該欄位出現之值的 epoch 時間。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6380 
msgid ""
"Returns the event count, broken out by each index/server/provider triplet"
" in the result set."
msgstr "傳回事件計數，依據結果集中每個 index/server/provider 三元組進行細分。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2133 
msgid "Returns the first n number of specified results."
msgstr "傳回指定結果的第一個數。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2135 
msgid ""
"Returns the first n results, or 10 if no integer is specified.\\\n"
"New for 4.0, can provide a boolean eval expression, in which case we "
"return events until that expression evaluates to false."
msgstr ""
"傳回前 n 個結果，或若未指定整數的話則傳回 10。\\\n"
"4.0 版新功能，可提供布林 eval 運算式，這樣的話會傳回事件，直到該運算式評估為 false 為止。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2151 
msgid "Returns the last n number of specified results."
msgstr "傳回指定結果的最後一個數。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2153 
msgid ""
"Returns the last n results, or 10 if no integer is specified.  The "
"events\\\n"
"are returned in reverse order, starting at the end of the result set."
msgstr ""
"傳回最後 n 個結果，或若未指定整數的話則傳回 10。從結果集的末端開始，\\\n"
"以反向順序傳回事件。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4481 
msgid ""
"Returns the list of values for the metric_name or dimension fields from "
"all metric indexes, \\\n"
"unless an index name is specified in the WHERE clause. The '_values' "
"field is not allowed.  \\\n"
"Supports GROUPBY on the metric_name or dimension fields, however you "
"cannot specify a time  \\\n"
"span with this command. \\i\\\\\n"
"Arguments:"
"                                                                                                                                                "
"\\i\\\\\n"
"\"prestats\": Returns the results in prestats format. You can pipe the "
"results into another command that takes prestats output, such as chart or"
" timechart. \\i\\\\\n"
"This is useful for creating graphs. Default is \"prestats=false\"."
"                                                                              "
"\\i\\\\\n"
"\"append\": Valid only when \"prestats=true\". This argument runs the "
"mstats command and adds"
"                                                                 \\i\\\\"
"\n"
"the results to an existing set of results instead of generating new "
"results. Default is \"append=false\"."
msgstr ""
"從所有度量索引傳回 metric_name 或維度欄位的值清單，\\\n"
"除非 WHERE 子距中已指定索引名稱。不允許使用「_values」欄位。  \\\n"
"支援 metric_name 或維度欄位上的 GROUPBY，不過，您無法使用此命令指定\\\n"
"時間跨距。\\i\\\\\n"
"引數:                                                                                                                                                \\i\\\\\n"
"\\”prestats\\”: 傳回 prestat 格式的結果。您可以將結果輸送至其他接收 prestats 輸出的命令，例如 chart或 timechart。\\i\\\\\n"
"此作法在建立圖形時相當實用。預設為 \\”prestats=false\\”。                                                                              \\i\\\\\n"
"\\”append\\”: 僅在 \\”prestats=true\\” 時有效。此引數會執行 mstats 命令並將                                                                 \\i\\\\\n"
"結果新增至現有的結果集而非產生新的結果。預設為 \\”append=false\\”。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:6359 
msgid "Returns the number of events in an index."
msgstr "傳回索引內的事件數。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4955 
msgid ""
"Returns the per second rate change of the value of the field.  Requires "
"the earliest and latest value of the field to be numerical and the "
"earliest_time and latest_time of the field to be different."
msgstr "傳回欄位值的每秒速率變化。欄位的最舊值與最新值必須為數值，且欄位的 earliest_time 與 latest_time 必須不同。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5574 
msgid ""
"Returns the sum across the individual time series rates.  Requires at "
"least one rate value of the field to calculate the rate sum. Valid for "
"mstats only."
msgstr "傳回個別時間系列速率的總和。需要至少一個欄位的速率值才能計算速率總和。僅對 mstats 有效。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5899 
msgid "Returns typeahead on a specified prefix."
msgstr "傳回指定字首的 typeahead。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5901 
msgid ""
"Returns typeahead on a specified prefix. Only returns a max of \"count\" "
"results, can be targeted to an index and restricted by time. \\\n"
"If index specifiers are provided they're used to populate the set of "
"indexes used if no index specifiers are found in the prefix."
msgstr ""
"傳回指定字首的 typeahead。僅傳回 [count] 結果的最大值，可以索引為目標並以時間進行限制。\\\n"
"若提供了索引指定子，會用來填入字首找不到索引指定子時要使用的一組索引。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2169 
msgid "Reverse the order of a result set."
msgstr "反轉結果集順序。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2167 
#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:2168 
msgid "Reverses the order of the results."
msgstr "反轉結果順序。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1575 
msgid ""
"Reverses the order of the values in multivalue field \"b\" to \"3\", "
"\"2\", \"1\" in multivalue field \"a\"."
msgstr "將多重值欄位「b」的值順序反轉為多重值欄位「a」中的「3」、「2」、「1」。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1571 
msgid "Reverses the order of the values in the multivalue field \"a\"."
msgstr "反轉多重值欄位「a」中的值順序。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1573 
msgid ""
"Reverses the order of the values in the multivalue field by changing "
"\"1\", \"2\", \"3\" to \"3\", \"2\", \"1\"."
msgstr "透過將「1」、「2」、「3」變更為「3」、「2」、「1」，反轉多重值欄位中的值順序。"

#. TRANS: Button to re-generate field values
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/web/search_mrsparkle/templates/etb/index.html:103 
msgid "Revert edits"
msgstr "還原編輯"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/packages/admin-user-xp/src/features/lookupTableFiles/texts.ts:52 
msgid "Revert to this version"
msgstr "還原至此版本"

#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/packages/admin-user-xp/src/features/authorizationFieldFilters/i18n/messages.ts:155 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/packages/admin-user-xp/src/features/federation/providers/amazonS3/constants/stepsConfig.ts:15 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/packages/admin-user-xp/src/features/federation/providers/amazonS3/screens/Summary/index.tsx:38 
#: /Users/thopayto/Projects/splunkcore-web-ui/packages/admin-user-xp/src/features/federation/providers/asl/constants/stepsConfig.ts:40 
