#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1784 
msgid ""
"Run a streaming subsearch that uses a template to iterate over each field"
" in a wildcarded field list, or over each value in a single multivalue "
"field or in a single field representing a JSON array."
msgstr "執行使用範本迭代萬用字元欄位清單中的每個欄位或單一多值欄位或表格示 JSON 陣列的單一欄位中的每個值的串流子搜尋。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1796 
msgid ""
"Run a templated streaming subsearch for each field in a wildcarded field "
"list.  \\i\\\\\n"
"For each field that is matched, the following patterns will be replaced "
"in the templated subsearch:  \\i\\\\\n"
"option         default          replacement \\i\\\\\n"
"fieldstr       <<FIELD>>        whole field name \\i\\\\\n"
"matchstr       <<MATCHSTR>>     part of the field name that matches "
"wildcards (\"*\") in the specifier \\i\\\\\n"
"matchseg1      <<MATCHSEG1>>    part of field name that matches first "
"wildcard \\i\\\\\n"
"matchseg2      <<MATCHSEG2>>    part of field name that matches second "
"wildcard \\i\\\\\n"
"matchseg3      <<MATCHSEG3>>    part of field name that matches third "
"wildcard  \\i\\\\\n"
"itemstr        <<ITEM>>         optional placeholder for elements in the "
"multivalued field / JSON array. \\i\\\\\n"
"iterstr        <<ITER>>         optional placeholder for a zero-based "
"iterator in the multivalued field / JSON array. \\i\\\\\n"
"You can iterate over the contents of a JSON array or multivalue field by "
"setting 'mode=json_array' or  'mode=multivalue'. Then, add '<<ITEM>>' to "
"your subsearch as a reference to the iterable object. To dynamically "
"support iteration over a JSON array or multivalued field, use "
"'mode=auto_collections'. \\i\\\\\n"
"When 'mode=multifield', the default behavior for iteration occurs over "
"all fields specified in the wildcarded field list."
msgstr ""
"針對含萬用字元的欄位清單中的每個欄位，執行範本化的串流子搜尋。  \\i\\\\\n"
"對於每個符合的欄位，將在範本化的子搜尋中取代下列模式：  \\i\\\\\n"
"選項         預設值          取代內容 \\i\\\\\n"
"fieldstr       <<FIELD>>        完整欄位名稱 \\i\\\\\n"
"matchstr       <<MATCHSTR>>     欄位名稱中符合指定詞中的萬用字元 (\"*\") 的部分 \\i\\\\\n"
"matchseg1      <<MATCHSEG1>>    欄位名稱中符合第一個萬用字元的部分 \\i\\\\\n"
"matchseg2      <<MATCHSEG2>>    欄位名稱中符合第二個萬用字元的部分 \\i\\\\\n"
"matchseg3      <<MATCHSEG3>>    欄位名稱中符合第三個萬用字元的部分  \\i\\\\\n"
"itemstr        <<ITEM>>         多值欄位 / JSON 陣列中元素的選用預留位置。 \\i\\\\\n"
"iterstr        <<ITER>>         多值欄位 / JSON 陣列中以零為起點之迭代器的選用預留位置。 \\i\\\\\n"
"您可以透過設定 'mode=json_array' 或  'mode=multivalue' 來迭代 JSON 陣列或多值欄位的內容。然後，在子搜尋中加入 '<<ITEM>>'，作為對可迭代物件的參照。若要以動態方式支援對 JSON 陣列或多值欄位的迭代，請使用 'mode=auto_collections'。 \\i\\\\\n"
"當 'mode=multifield' 時，迭代的預設行為會套用至含萬用字元的欄位清單中指定的所有欄位。"

