#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:4995 
msgid ""
"Stitch together fields and/or strings to create a new field.  \\\n"
"Quoted tokens are assumed to be literals and the rest field names.  \\\n"
"The destination field name is always at the end. \\\n"
"If allrequired=t, for each event the destination field is only \\\n"
"written to if all source fields exist.  If allrequired=f (default) \\\n"
"the destination field is always written and any source fields \\\n"
"that do not exist are treated as empty string."
msgstr ""
"將欄位和/或字串拼接起來，以建立新欄位。\\\n"
"加上引號的 token 會被假定為文字，其他為欄位名稱。\\\n"
"目的地欄位名稱一律在結尾處。\\\n"
"若 allrequired=t，對於各個事件而言，唯有所有來源欄位都存在，才會\\\n"
"寫入目的地欄位。若 allrequired=f (預設)，\\\n"
"一律會寫入目的地欄位，任何不存在的來源欄位\\\n"
"會被視為空字串。"

