"for the join (default=true).  max indicates the maximum number of 'other'"
" results each main result can join with.  (default = 1, 0 means no "
"limit).  'keepsingle' controls whether or not results with a unique value"
" for the join fields (and thus no other results to join with) should be "
"retained.  (default = false)"
msgstr "selfjoin 會將各結果與 join 欄位具有相同值的其他結果聯結。[overwrite] 控制其他結果欄位是否應覆寫基礎結果欄位 (預設=true)。max 表示各個主結果可聯結的其他結果數上限。(預設 = 1，0 表示無限制)。[keepsingle] 控制是否應保留 join 欄位具有唯一值的結果 (因此沒有其他結果可以聯結)。(預設 = false)"

