#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1487 
msgid ""
"This function computes the arc cosine of X, in the interval [0,pi] "
"radians."
msgstr "此函數會以間隔 [0,pi] 弧度計算 X 的反餘弦。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1489 
msgid "This function computes the arc hyperbolic cosine of X, in radians."
msgstr "此函數會以弧度計算 X 的反雙曲餘弦。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1493 
msgid "This function computes the arc hyperbolic sine of X, in radians."
msgstr "此函數會以弧度計算 X 的反雙曲正弦。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1499 
msgid "This function computes the arc hyperbolic tangent of X, in radians."
msgstr "此函數會以弧度計算 X 的反雙曲正切。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1491 
msgid ""
"This function computes the arc sine of X, in the interval [-pi/2,+pi/2] "
"radians."
msgstr "此函數會以間隔 [-pi/2,+pi/2] 弧度計算 X 的反正弦。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1495 
msgid ""
"This function computes the arc tangent of X, in the interval "
"[-pi/2,+pi/2] radians."
msgstr "此函數會以間隔 [-pi/2,+pi/2] 弧度計算 X 的反正切。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1497 
msgid ""
"This function computes the arc tangent of Y, X in the interval [-pi,+pi] "
"radians. Y is a value that represents the proportion of the y-coordinate."
" X is the value that represents the proportion of the x-coordinate. To "
"compute the value, the function takes into account the sign of both "
"arguments to determine the quadrant."
msgstr "此函數會以間隔 [-pi,+pi] 弧度計算 Y, X 的反正切。Y 是代表 y 座標比例的值。X 是代表 x 座標比例的值。為了計算該值，此函數會考量這兩個引數的正負號來決定象限。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1501 
msgid "This function computes the cosine of an angle of X radians."
msgstr "此函數會計算 X 弧度角度的餘弦。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1503 
msgid "This function computes the hyperbolic cosine of X radians."
msgstr "此函數會計算 X 弧度的雙曲餘弦。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1509 
msgid "This function computes the hyperbolic sine."
msgstr "此函數會計算雙曲正弦。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1513 
msgid "This function computes the hyperbolic tangent."
msgstr "此函數會計算雙曲正切。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1505 
msgid ""
"This function computes the hypotenuse of a right-angled triangle whose "
"legs are X and Y. The function returns the square root of the sum of the "
"squares of X and Y, as described in the Pythagorean theorem."
msgstr "此函數會計算其股為 X 與 Y 之直角三角形的斜邊。此函數會傳回 X 平方與 Y 平方總和的平方根，如畢氏定理所述。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1507 
msgid "This function computes the sine."
msgstr "此函數會計算正弦。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1511 
msgid "This function computes the tangent."
msgstr "此函數會計算正切。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1383 
msgid ""
"This function enables you to specify a conditional that is obviously "
"false, for example 1==0. You do not specify a field with this function."
msgstr "此函數可讓您指定明顯為 false 的條件式，例如 1==0。您未透過此函數指定欄位。"

#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1449 
msgid ""
"This function enables you to specify a conditional that is obviously "
"true, for example 1==1. You do not specify a field with this function."
msgstr "此函數可讓您指定明顯為 true 的條件式，例如 1==1。您未透過此函數指定欄位。"

