#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:1415 
msgid ""
"This function tries to find a value in multivalue field X that matches "
"the regular expression REGEX. If a match exists, the index of the first "
"matching value is returned (beginning with zero). If no values match, "
"NULL is returned."
