#: default/searchbnf.conf.in:5233 
msgid ""
"Timechart options for controlling the behavior of splitting by a field.  "
"\\\n"
"See the bin command for details about the <bin-options>. \\\n"
"In addition to the <bin-options>: \\\n"
"The usenull option controls whether or not a series is \\\n"
"created for events that do not contain the split-by field. \\\n"
"This series is labeled by the value of the nullstr option, and defaults "
"to NULL. \\\n"
"The useother option specifies if a series should be added for data series"
" not \\\n"
"included in the graph because they did not meet the criteria of the "
"<where-clause>. \\\n"
"This series is labeled by the value of the otherstr option, and defaults "
"to OTHER."
msgstr ""
"用於控制依欄位分割行為的時間圖表選項。\\\n"
"請參閱 bin 命令以取得有關 <bin-options> 的詳細資料。\\\n"
"除了 <bin-options>: \\\n"
"usenull 選項會控制是否要為未包含 [split-by] 欄位的事件\\\n"
"建立系列。\\\n"
"此系列會以 nullstr 選項的值作為標籤，預設為 NULL。\\\n"
"useother 選項會指定是否要為因不符合 <where-clause> 的準則而未包含於圖表中的資料系列\\\n"
"新增系列。\\\n"
"此系列以 otherstr 選項的值作為標籤，預設為 OTHER。"

